{"product_id":"the-world-were-in","title":"The World We're in","description":"\u003cp\u003e'The World We're In, like its predecessor, is a timely and forward looking book . . . [it] ranges widely over a thorough analysis of the contemporary global economic situation, but the argument gradually hones in on a plea for Britain to turn its back on the shareholder-value-obsessed American economic model and adopt the less short-term financial systems in place in continental Europe . . .Hutton's powerful and flawlessly argued assertion is that to opt for dependence upon America is madness . . .These are arguments we should all hear, if nothing else, because it won't be long before we are called out to tick a 'yes' or 'no' box on the question of Euro membership.' William Sutcliffe, Independent on Sunday \u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:126 x 194  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Will Hutton \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9780349114712 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format: Paperback \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 528\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43616731496601,"sku":"16RB-3-9780349114712","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/e44b298aebcfa76efe4c513baf2ee1c2.jpg?v=1700724412","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/the-world-were-in","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}